Redis commands

redis-cli info stats | grep 'keyspace_*'  ->  This command shows no. of cache hits and cache missed
redis-cli keys '*'  ->  Get information for all cache keys
redis-cli FLUSHDB  ->  clear your cache
docs - https://medium.com/@MatthewFTech/spring-boot-cache-with-redis-56026f7da83a


Corn

Scheduling Format  ->  6 stars represent 6 different things
*      *     *      *      *        *
Sec   Min   Hour   Day   Month   DayOfTheWeek

0  0  9  *  *  *  -> Everyday at 9AM
0  30  9  *  *  *  -> Everyday at 9:30AM
0  30  9  *  *  1  -> Every Monday[1] at 9:30AM

*  *  *  *  *  *  -> Run every second post deployment
0  *  *  *  *  *  -> Run every Minute post deployment
0  0  *  *  *  *  -> Run every hour post deployment